<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">skulduggery</ansi> (skill)

The <ansi fg="skill">skulduggery</ansi> skill encompasses the arts of
stealth, misdirection, and larceny. As your skill grows,
you unlock increasingly devious techniques.

<ansi fg="yellow">Abilities: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="skill">sneak [direction]</ansi>
    Move unseen for a time, remaining hidden even when
    traveling between rooms.

  <ansi fg="skill">bump [target]</ansi>
    Jostle a target, causing some of their coins to
    spill onto the ground. Relies on your physical
    prowess relative to theirs.

  <ansi fg="skill">backstab [target]</ansi>
    Strike from the shadows for a devastating critical
    hit. You must be sneaking to attempt this.

  <ansi fg="skill">pickpocket [target]</ansi>
    Deftly lift coins or items from a target while
    hidden. Your agility, wits, and awareness all play
    a role, and being unseen improves your chances.

<ansi fg="yellow">Related: </ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help sneak</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">help skills</ansi>

